{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_ecs_dynamodb_rps_ceiling_attribution_via_metrics_design", "label": "Attribution-via-Metrics Design Spec (2026-08-31)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-ecs-dynamodb-rps-ceiling-attribution-via-metrics-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_ecs_dynamodb_rps_ceiling_attribution_via_metrics_design", "label": "Spec: attribution via metrics", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-ecs-dynamodb-rps-ceiling-attribution-via-metrics-design.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Move every measurement signal into the OTel pipeline and delete the HTTP measurement surfaces."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_ecs_dynamodb_rps_ceiling_attribution_via_metrics_design_delete_server_timing_stats", "label": "A1: delete Server-Timing header and GET /stats", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-ecs-dynamodb-rps-ceiling-attribution-via-metrics-design.md", "source_location": "\u00a72", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A response header is a transport for the client; k6 is a test harness not a consumer, and event-loop lag was already flowing from RuntimeNodeInstrumentation."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_ecs_dynamodb_rps_ceiling_attribution_via_metrics_design_db_cpu_histograms", "label": "A3: http.server.db.duration and http.server.cpu.duration histograms", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-ecs-dynamodb-rps-ceiling-attribution-via-metrics-design.md", "source_location": "\u00a72, \u00a73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two names instead of one with a phase label, so a query omitting the selector cannot silently average unlike distributions."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_ecs_dynamodb_rps_ceiling_attribution_via_metrics_design_queueing_signal", "label": "Derived queueing signal (in-process db \u2212 SuccessfulRequestLatency)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-ecs-dynamodb-rps-ceiling-attribution-via-metrics-design.md", "source_location": "\u00a75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A5: in-process db absorbs event-loop queueing, so the gap between the two clocks was intended as the queueing measurement; must use histogram_sum/histogram_count since native histograms have no _sum series."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_ecs_dynamodb_rps_ceiling_attribution_via_metrics_design_attribution_table", "label": "Four-row attribution table (DELETED 2026-09-01)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-ecs-dynamodb-rps-ceiling-attribution-via-metrics-design.md", "source_location": "\u00a75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_ecs_dynamodb_rps_ceiling_attribution_via_metrics_design_queries_json", "label": "A8: generated grafana/queries.json (sixth slo.yaml output)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-ecs-dynamodb-rps-ceiling-attribution-via-metrics-design.md", "source_location": "\u00a76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One definition, three consumers (dashboard, /loadtest, README deep-links), byte-checked by slo:check to prevent drift."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_ecs_dynamodb_rps_ceiling_attribution_via_metrics_design_readme_by_question", "label": "A9: README organised by question, CLI as appendix", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-ecs-dynamodb-rps-ceiling-attribution-via-metrics-design.md", "source_location": "\u00a78", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Someone asking 'is it healthy?' should not read a Terraform command to find out; deep-links are generated because hand-typed panel ids rot."}, {"id": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_ecs_dynamodb_rps_ceiling_attribution_via_metrics_design_pbkdf2_iterations_2662", "label": "A10: pbkdf2_iterations stays 2662", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-ecs-dynamodb-rps-ceiling-attribution-via-metrics-design.md", "source_location": "\u00a72, \u00a711", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Churning it moves the service ceiling and makes runs incomparable \u2014 worse than a sub-1% CPU drift; calibrate.js cannot observe instrumentation cost anyway."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_ecs_dynamodb_rps_ceiling_attribution_via_metrics_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_29_ecs_dynamodb_rps_ceiling_design", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-ecs-dynamodb-rps-ceiling-attribution-via-metrics-design.md", "source_location": "header: Amends", "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_ecs_dynamodb_rps_ceiling_attribution_via_metrics_design", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_30_ecs_dynamodb_rps_ceiling_sli_collection_design", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-ecs-dynamodb-rps-ceiling-attribution-via-metrics-design.md", "source_location": "header: Amends", "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_31_ecs_dynamodb_rps_ceiling_attribution_via_metrics_design_delete_server_timing_stats", "target": "docs_superpowers_sp